  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/shroomcraft/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/shroomcraft/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Fuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/shroomcraft/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Shroomcraft</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 擴大了 Minecraft 的真菌家族，帶來新的蘑菇類型、可愛的生物和為蘑菇島注入新鮮生命的植被。從微型嫩芽到高聳的巨物，你可以發現橙色、紫色和藍色的蘑菇與經典的棕色和紅色蘑菇共生。每種類型都配有相匹配的木材、方塊和裝飾品，為建造者提供了豐富的色彩和質地調色板，適合營造溫馨的構建與活潑的景觀。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">島上的生活從未如此熱鬧。磨菇牛現在出現在每一種新顏色中，並伴背負蘑菇的奇特雞——克魯什穆（Cluckshrooms）。你甚至可能遇到罕見的游泳菌鱗魚（Shroomfin）。在表面之下，發光的菌絲體生長照亮了洞穴，孢子可以被製成蘑菇炸藥，增添一點點惡作劇的樂趣。探索、建造，並在你自己的蘑菇天堂中茁壯成長。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/shroomcraft/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🍄 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">新蘑菇：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">橙色、紫色和藍色蘑菇與經典的棕色和紅色蘑菇一起生長。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌳 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">蘑菇木材：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">每種蘑菇類型都有完整的木材套件，供創意建築使用。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🐄 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">磨菇牛變種：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">獨特的蘑菇牛覆蓋五種主世界和兩種地獄真菌。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🐔 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">克魯什穆（Cluckshrooms）：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">背部長有蘑菇的雞和平生活在蘑菇島上。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🐟 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">菌鱗魚（Shroomfin Fish）：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">在蘑菇島內及周圍水域發現的新魚類。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌱 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">蘑菇幼苗：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">各種顏色的微小植被增添了島嶼的細節。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">💥 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">蘑菇炸藥：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> throwable 的孢子釋放持續有害效果。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌌 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">菌絲體生長：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">發光的洞穴真菌像發光的地衣一樣照亮地下。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌾 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px.;\">小型蘑菇：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">透過孢子輕鬆種植小蘑菇以便耕作。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/shroomcraft/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/shroomcraft/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/shroomcraft/media/2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/shroomcraft/media/3.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/shroomcraft/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">客戶端需要安裝且服務器端也需要安裝</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/puzzles-lib\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（Fabric &amp; NeoForge）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/forge-config-api-port\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/shroomcraft/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">如果模塊提供配置，則可以直接通過遊戲內的模塊菜單進行配置（Fabric 需要安裝由 Prospector 提供的 Mod Menu）。請注意，在某些較舊的 Minecraft 版本中，安裝 Forge Config Screens 也是必需的。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">如需使用外部文本編輯器手動配置，所有文件位於 <code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">.minecraft/config</span></code>，文件名為 <code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code>、<code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code> 或 <code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code>，取決於配置文件類型。並非所有模塊都會存在所有類型的配置。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/shroomcraft/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感謝 Dayiel 的出色作品 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/shroomed\">Shroomed</a> 模塊，其迷人的資源幫助塑造了本項目的美學風格。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感謝才華橫溢的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/mim1q\">mim1q</a> 創造了鮮豔生動的紋理，為這個模塊增添了活力十足的風格。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/shroomcraft/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/hang-glider\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/hangglider/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/cut-through\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/cutthrough/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/diagonal-fences\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/diagonalfences/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/shroomcraft/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/shroomcraft/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>",
